# Persistence and portable launch values, vendored byte-identical from the working tree. One path per line; an optional
# second, tab-separated field renames the copy (only where a basename would mislead).
#
# There are no stand-ins. There used to be two — `TerminalThemeID` extracted from an AppKit file,
# and `SettingsEvents` minus its AppKit-bearing last four lines — and both were *recommendations*
# written as code. They landed on master as c9a43797c and 1f33a569c, so the real files are taken
# here verbatim and the stand-ins are gone, exactly as `standins.sh` said they would be.
#
# `TerminalTheme.swift` and `TerminalProfile.swift` are absent on purpose: they still import AppKit,
# and after those two splits nothing in the slice needs them.
